00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:13.003
Finally.

00:09:13.629 --> 00:09:15.379
You know, I really needed this win.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:17.503
- I lost.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.980
I expected her to really not notice

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.820
the nuances that I could've

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:22.653
put into the cake,

00:09:22.653 --> 00:09:23.690
so I kept it really simple

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.253
and focus on the decoration.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.360
But maybe I should've taken

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.960
those extra moments to really put in

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.920
all the extra pizazz and flavor

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.753
into the cake,

00:09:30.753 --> 00:09:31.586
and the cookie itself.

00:09:31.586 --> 00:09:32.900
- 'Cause you're the winner,

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.397
you get a big,

00:09:36.071 --> 00:09:37.571
a big frame

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.010
of my picture that I drew.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.830
- Thank you so much.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.063
This is amazing.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.170
This is so, so sweet.

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:46.003
It kind of,

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.440
it kind of looks like it, right?

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.273
- Yeah.

00:09:48.273 --> 00:09:49.106
- Yeah, kind of.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:49.943
- I feel pretty good.

00:09:49.943 --> 00:09:50.776
What am I gonna do with this,

00:09:50.776 --> 00:09:51.973
hang it over my bed,

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.240
put it in my living room,

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.353
send this to my mom?

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:55.223
I don't know.

00:09:55.223 --> 00:09:56.240
I'm pretty proud though.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.640
Do you wanna try?

00:09:58.657 --> 00:10:00.324
Do you wanna try it?

00:10:01.359 --> 00:10:03.942
(upbeat music)

